From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zahary Karadjov <zahary@metacraft-labs.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:17:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] nixos-25.05: keep tuwunel out of module-list.nix

Rebasing the series from nixos-unstable onto nixos-25.05 merges its
module-list.nix hunk without a conflict but carries along the context
line ./services/matrix/tuwunel.nix, a module 25.05 does not have; every
NixOS evaluation would then fail on the missing path. Drop that line
again, so the channel carries exactly the series' own change (one
`./services/misc/agent-harbor.nix` line).

Applied by the channel sync to nixos-25.05 only, after the rebase
(channels.json "fixups").
---
 nixos/modules/module-list.nix | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/nixos/modules/module-list.nix b/nixos/modules/module-list.nix
index c9c3f5ab1..d36764bbd 100644
--- a/nixos/modules/module-list.nix
+++ b/nixos/modules/module-list.nix
@@ -777,7 +777,6 @@
   ./services/matrix/pantalaimon.nix
   ./services/matrix/synapse-auto-compressor.nix
   ./services/matrix/synapse.nix
-  ./services/matrix/tuwunel.nix
   ./services/misc/agent-harbor.nix
   ./services/misc/airsonic.nix
   ./services/misc/amazon-ssm-agent.nix
